      "statement": "Sebi has proposed raising the annual ISIN limit for private debt securities from 14 to 17 to ease funding constraints and reduce refinancing risks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Reserve Bank of India tightened rules on consumer lending in December 2023.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Environment Agency (EA) is bringing a fraud case against four former Southern Water employees, including the former chief executive, over allegations they manipulated wastewater testing results.",
